    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "rule",
     "title": "Sa bukas? No.",
     "t": "**Sa bukas** is an exception: you do not add sa, because **bukas** alone is enough."
    },
    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "english",
     "title": "Same word, different time",
     "items": [
      "**noóng** isáng buwán = *last* month, but **sa** isáng buwán = *next* month.",
      "**noóng** Martes = *last* Tuesday, but **sa** Martes = *next* Tuesday.",
      "**ngayóng** umaga = this morning (it is still morning), but **kanínang** umága = this morning (it is now afternoon).",
      "**kamakalawá** = day *before yesterday*, but **samakalawá** = day *after tomorrow*."
     ]
    },
