      "The future sentences use future verbs (áalis, púpunta, dádalaw, áawit, tútugtóg) with future words (mámayâ, búkas, sa isáng linggó).",
      "The past sentence uses a past verb (pumuntá) with a past phrase (noóng isáng buwán).",
      "**Sa** + time says *at* that time: sa ikapitó ng umaga, *at seven in the morning*.",
      "The sentences write búkas and hapon, while the lists write bukas and hápon. They are the same words."
     ]
    },
